sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as Mock Clinical Agent
    participant GW as Gateway API<br/>(app/api/agent/action-request)
    participant PS as Prompt Shield<br/>(Azure AI Content Safety)
    participant Inv as Investigator<br/>(bounded, ≤5 tool calls)
    participant FDA as openFDA<br/>(lookup_drug_label)
    participant Meds as Synthea Meds<br/>(get_patient_current_medications)
    participant PE as Policy Engine<br/>(deterministic rule table)
    participant DB as Supabase Postgres
    participant Foundry as Microsoft Foundry<br/>(OTel spans)
    participant RQ as Review Queue UI
    participant Rev as Reviewer

    Agent->>GW: POST /api/agent/action-request<br/>{agent_id, action_type, payload, context}
    GW->>GW: validate request against schema<br/>(reject 400 if malformed)

    GW->>PS: screen payload content
    PS-->>GW: injection_flag
    GW-->>Foundry: span: Prompt Shield call

    Inv->>Meds: get_patient_current_medications(patient_context_id)<br/>[eager — not agentic, v3 latency fix]
    Meds-->>Inv: medications list
    GW->>Inv: payload + injection_flag + patient_current_medications
    loop up to 5 lookup_drug_label calls
        Inv->>FDA: lookup_drug_label(drug_name)
        FDA-->>Inv: contraindications, warnings, boxed_warning, interactions
        Inv-->>Foundry: span: investigator tool call
    end
    Inv-->>GW: risk_tier, reasoning, evidence_sources
    GW-->>Foundry: span: investigator final output

    GW->>PE: risk_tier + injection_flag
    PE-->>GW: decision (auto_approve | escalate | block)
    GW-->>Foundry: span: policy engine decision

    GW->>DB: insert agent_actions, risk_classifications, incidents<br/>(append-only)
    GW-->>Agent: response {decision, risk_tier, reasoning,<br/>evidence_sources, incident_id, latency_ms, token_cost}

    opt decision == escalate
        DB->>RQ: incident surfaces (decision = 'escalate')
        Rev->>RQ: reviews payload, risk tier, reasoning
        Rev->>RQ: approve / reject
        RQ->>DB: insert review_decisions<br/>(append-only)
    end

    Note over GW,PE: Any timeout, error, or low-confidence result<br/>at Prompt Shield, Investigator, or Policy Engine<br/>routes to escalate — fail closed, never auto_approve.
